  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The live finale of Twelve Singers goes on the air across the country as host Wen Simo welcomes mystery guest Li Mingji, before a sudden medical emergency stops the show. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现场以及电视机前所有的观众朋友们，大家晚上好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "欢迎各位来到十二歌王决赛之夜。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天晚上是现场直播。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "首先，有请我们的神秘嘉宾出场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有没有关系，你说了不算。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不是她做的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们别找她了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "李先生晕倒的事跟她没有任何关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "大家先别激动，等医院的消息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "请现场观众朋友们保持安静。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现场以及电视机前所有的观众朋友们，大家晚上好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good evening to all our friends in the studio audience and watching at home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "欢迎各位来到十二歌王决赛之夜。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Welcome everyone to the finale night of Twelve Singers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天晚上是现场直播。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tonight's programme is a live broadcast.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "首先，有请我们的神秘嘉宾出场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'First, please welcome our mystery guest to the stage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有没有关系，你说了不算。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whether it is related or not is not up to you to decide.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不是她做的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She did not do this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们别找她了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop going after her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "李先生晕倒的事跟她没有任何关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Li collapsing onstage has nothing whatsoever to do with her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "大家先别激动，等医院的消息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone stay calm first and wait for word from the hospital.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "请现场观众朋友们保持安静。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would our studio audience friends please remain calm and quiet.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现场以及电视机前所有的观众朋友们，大家晚上好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
